{%- comment -%} PawBoard one-page store {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign hero_product = settings.hero_product -%}
{%- if hero_product == blank or hero_product.title == blank -%}{%- assign hero_product = all_products['pawboard'] -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign rating = settings.rating_value | default: '4.8' -%}
{%- assign reviews = settings.review_count | default: '1,200+' -%}

{% render 'hero-buy', product: hero_product %}

{%- comment -%} Benefits {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="benefits" id="why">
  <div class="container">
    <ul class="benefits-grid">
      <li>
        <span class="benefit-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'stress' %}</span>
        <h3>Relieves stress</h3>
        <p>No more scary clippers or vet visits just for nails.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="benefit-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'heart' %}</span>
        <h3>Builds confidence</h3>
        <p>Turns nail care into a fun, rewarding activity.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="benefit-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'shield' %}</span>
        <h3>Supports long-term health</h3>
        <p>Helps prevent overgrown nails and joint issues.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="benefit-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'paw' %}</span>
        <h3>Strengthens your bond</h3>
        <p>A positive experience you'll both love.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} Vet quote + why dogs prefer {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="section vet">
  <div class="container vet-grid">
    <div class="vet-card">
      <div class="vet-photo">
        {% render 'photo', image: settings.img_vet, fallback: 'pb-vet.jpg', alt: 'Veterinarian with a golden retriever', width: 700 %}
      </div>
      <div class="vet-quote">
        <span class="vet-quote-mark">{% render 'icon', name: 'quote' %}</span>
        <blockquote>
          <p>&ldquo;PawBoard is a smart, low-stress solution that helps dogs maintain healthy nails through natural behavior and positive reinforcement. I highly recommend it to my clients.&rdquo;</p>
          <footer>
            <strong>Dr. Emily Carter</strong>
            <span>DVM, Small Animal Veterinarian</span>
          </footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="why">
      <span class="why-watermark" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'icon', name: 'paw' %}</span>
      <div class="section-title section-title--icon">
        <span class="title-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'paw' %}</span>
        <h2>Why dogs prefer<br>PawBoard</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Dogs love to scratch &mdash; it's natural! PawBoard taps into this instinct, turning nail care into a fun and satisfying game. With treats and praise, dogs quickly learn to use it on their own.</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><span class="check">{% render 'icon', name: 'check' %}</span> Feels natural and fun</li>
        <li><span class="check">{% render 'icon', name: 'check' %}</span> Rewards-based training</li>
        <li><span class="check">{% render 'icon', name: 'check' %}</span> No force, no fear</li>
        <li><span class="check">{% render 'icon', name: 'check' %}</span> Dogs learn quickly</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} Comparison {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="section compare" id="compare">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>A kinder, calmer alternative</h2>
      <p>Traditional nail trimming can be stressful for dogs and owners. PawBoard offers a gentle, positive way to keep nails healthy &mdash; no clippers, no struggle.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-grid">
      <div class="compare-card compare-card--old">
        <h3>Traditional Nail Clipping</h3>
        <div class="compare-body">
          <div class="compare-photo">
            {% render 'photo', image: settings.img_clipping, fallback: 'pb-clipping.jpg', alt: 'A puppy having its nails clipped', width: 600 %}
          </div>
          <ul class="compare-list">
            <li><span class="mark mark--x">{% render 'icon', name: 'x' %}</span> Can cause anxiety and fear</li>
            <li><span class="mark mark--x">{% render 'icon', name: 'x' %}</span> Risk of cutting too short</li>
            <li><span class="mark mark--x">{% render 'icon', name: 'x' %}</span> Often requires vet visits</li>
            <li><span class="mark mark--x">{% render 'icon', name: 'x' %}</span> Stressful for both dog and owner</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="compare-card compare-card--new">
        <h3>With PawBoard</h3>
        <div class="compare-body">
          <div class="compare-photo">
            {% render 'photo', image: settings.img_with_pawboard, fallback: 'pb-golden-board.jpg', alt: 'A golden retriever using PawBoard', width: 600 %}
          </div>
          <ul class="compare-list">
            <li><span class="mark mark--check">{% render 'icon', name: 'check' %}</span> Natural and stress-free</li>
            <li><span class="mark mark--check">{% render 'icon', name: 'check' %}</span> Dogs stay in control</li>
            <li><span class="mark mark--check">{% render 'icon', name: 'check' %}</span> Builds confidence at home</li>
            <li><span class="mark mark--check">{% render 'icon', name: 'check' %}</span> A positive, rewarding experience</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-script">Happier dogs<br>healthier lives <span class="script-heart">{% render 'icon', name: 'heart' %}</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} Reviews {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="section reviews" id="reviews">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title section-title--split">
      <div class="section-title--icon">
        <span class="title-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'paw' %}</span>
        <div>
          <h2>Real dogs. Real results.</h2>
          <p>Join thousands of happy pups and their humans.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="reviews-summary">
        <div class="reviews-summary-stars">{% render 'stars', size: 'lg' %} <strong>{{ rating }} out of 5</strong></div>
        <p>Based on {{ reviews }} verified reviews</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reviews-grid">
      <article class="review-card">
        <div class="review-photo">{% render 'photo', image: settings.img_review_1, fallback: 'pb-jack-russell.jpg', alt: 'Jack Russell puppy beside PawBoard', width: 500 %}</div>
        <div class="review-body">
          <div class="review-top">{% render 'stars' %} <span class="pill pill--green">{% render 'icon', name: 'check' %} Best!</span></div>
          <h3>&ldquo;So easy to train!&rdquo;</h3>
          <p>My dog picked it up in just a few days. Now she scratches it every morning for a treat. No more nail trimming stress for either of us!</p>
          <footer><strong>Sarah L.</strong><span class="verified">{% render 'icon', name: 'verified' %} Verified Buyer</span></footer>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="review-card">
        <div class="review-photo">{% render 'photo', image: settings.img_review_2, fallback: 'pb-collie.jpg', alt: 'Border collie beside PawBoard', width: 500 %}</div>
        <div class="review-body">
          <div class="review-top">{% render 'stars' %}</div>
          <h3>&ldquo;Game changer!&rdquo;</h3>
          <p>I was skeptical at first, but this actually works. My dog loves it and his nails stay short and smooth. Such a simple but brilliant idea.</p>
          <footer><strong>Mike T.</strong><span class="verified">{% render 'icon', name: 'verified' %} Verified Buyer</span></footer>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="review-card">
        <div class="review-photo">{% render 'photo', image: settings.img_review_3, fallback: 'pb-golden-board.jpg', alt: 'Golden retriever using PawBoard', width: 500 %}</div>
        <div class="review-body">
          <div class="review-top">{% render 'stars' %}</div>
          <h3>&ldquo;Worth every penny.&rdquo;</h3>
          <p>High quality, easy to set up, and my dog genuinely enjoys using it. I love that it's a natural solution!</p>
          <footer><strong>Jessica M.</strong><span class="verified">{% render 'icon', name: 'verified' %} Verified Buyer</span></footer>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} Materials {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="section materials" id="materials">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title section-title--icon">
      <span class="title-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'paw' %}</span>
      <div>
        <h2>Quality materials. A safer choice.</h2>
        <p>Built with your dog's safety and well-being in mind.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="materials-grid">
      <div class="materials-photo">
        {% render 'photo', image: settings.img_materials, fallback: 'pb-materials.jpg', alt: 'Close-up of the PawBoard natural wood board and textured surface', width: 800 %}
      </div>
      <ul class="materials-list">
        <li>
          <span class="material-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'layers' %}</span>
          <div><h3>Durable, natural wood</h3><p>Sturdy, pet-safe wood built to last.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="material-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'texture' %}</span>
          <div><h3>Textured, non-slip surface</h3><p>Provides the perfect grip for safe scratching.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="material-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'stable' %}</span>
          <div><h3>Stable, anti-slip design</h3><p>Keeps the board steady during use.</p></div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="material-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'safe' %}</span>
          <div><h3>Pet-safe and non-toxic</h3><p>Free from harmful chemicals or finishes.</p></div>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="materials-card">
        <span class="materials-card-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'leaf' %}</span>
        <h3>Safe for your dog.<br>Better for the planet.</h3>
        <p>Made from natural, sustainable materials for a healthier, happier future &mdash; for pets and the planet.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} How to set up {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="section setup" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title section-title--icon">
      <span class="title-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'paw' %}</span>
      <div>
        <h2>How to set up PawBoard</h2>
        <p>Get started in just a few minutes!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="setup-grid">
      <ol class="steps">
        <li class="step">
          <div class="step-photo">
            <span class="step-num">1</span>
            {%- if settings.img_step_1 != blank -%}
              {% render 'photo', image: settings.img_step_1, fallback: 'pb-hero-dog.jpg', alt: 'PawBoard placed on a flat surface', width: 500 %}
            {%- elsif hero_product.title != blank and hero_product.featured_media -%}
              <img src="{{ hero_product.featured_media | image_url: width: 500 }}" alt="PawBoard placed on a flat surface" loading="lazy">
            {%- else -%}
              <img src="{{ 'pb-hero-dog.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="PawBoard placed on a flat surface" loading="lazy">
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
          <h3>Set it up</h3>
          <p>Unbox and place PawBoard on a flat surface.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step-arrow" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-right' %}</li>
        <li class="step">
          <div class="step-photo">
            <span class="step-num">2</span>
            {%- if settings.img_step_2 != blank -%}
              {% render 'photo', image: settings.img_step_2, fallback: 'pb-jack-russell.jpg', alt: 'Offering a treat to encourage scratching', width: 500 %}
            {%- else -%}
              <div class="step-illustration step-illustration--treat" role="img" aria-label="A hand offering a treat above the board">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M28 168 L112 118 L178 160 L178 172 L28 172 Z" fill="#E4C39B"/>
                  <path d="M28 168 L112 118 L112 132 L28 172 Z" fill="#D2AC7E"/>
                  <path d="M42 163 L112 123 L166 158 Z" fill="#2A2A2A"/>
                  <path d="M42 163 L112 123 L166 158" stroke="#F0D9BC" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                  <path d="M118 30c-10 0-16 12-16 26 0 10 3 18 3 26 0 14-6 22-6 34 0 10 8 16 18 16h18c10 0 18-6 18-16 0-12-6-20-6-34 0-8 3-16 3-26 0-14-6-26-16-26h-16Z" fill="#F4C9A8"/>
                  <path d="M104 78c-8 0-12 6-12 12s4 12 12 12" fill="#F4C9A8"/>
                  <path d="M134 60c-6 0-10 5-10 9 0 3 1 5 3 7-2 2-3 4-3 7 0 4 4 9 10 9 4 0 7-2 8-4 1 2 4 4 8 4 6 0 10-5 10-9 0-3-1-5-3-7 2-2 3-4 3-7 0-4-4-9-10-9-4 0-7 2-8 4-1-2-4-4-8-4Z" fill="#C98A4B"/>
                  <path d="M126 76h28" stroke="#B4773B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
          <h3>Add motivation</h3>
          <p>Use your dog's favorite treats to encourage scratching.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step-arrow" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-right' %}</li>
        <li class="step">
          <div class="step-photo">
            <span class="step-num">3</span>
            {% render 'photo', image: settings.img_step_3, fallback: 'pb-golden-board.jpg', alt: 'A dog learning to use PawBoard', width: 500 %}
          </div>
          <h3>Let them learn</h3>
          <p>Guide your dog at first, then let them enjoy and practice!</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <aside class="pro-tip">
        <span class="pro-tip-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'party' %}</span>
        <h3>Pro tip:</h3>
        <p>Keep sessions short, positive and rewarding. Most dogs learn within a few days!</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} FAQ {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="section faq" id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title section-title--icon">
      <span class="title-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'paw' %}</span>
      <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-grid">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How does PawBoard work? {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>PawBoard uses a textured, sandpaper-style surface on an angled wooden board. When your dog scratches at it (usually to reach a treat), their nails are gently filed down &mdash; no clippers, no restraint, no stress.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Is it safe for puppies? {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. The surface only files the nail tip, so it can't cut the quick. Puppies from around 12 weeks can start with short, supervised sessions.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What size dogs can use it? {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>PawBoard suits small to large breeds. The wide, stable base means everything from a Chihuahua to a Labrador can use it comfortably.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What materials is it made from? {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Natural, sustainably sourced wood with a pet-safe, non-toxic textured surface and an anti-slip base. No harmful chemicals or finishes.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How long does it take to see results? {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Most dogs learn the game within a few days. With a couple of short sessions a week, you'll notice shorter, smoother nails within two to three weeks.</p></div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Do you offer a guarantee? {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes &mdash; a 30-day money-back guarantee. If PawBoard isn't right for you and your pup, email <a href="mailto:{{ shop.email }}">{{ shop.email }}</a> for a full refund.</p></div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
